<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (On February 25, we hosted a Yoga Night at the Rec Centre for an evening dedicated to unwinding, resetting, and recharging. It was a great opportunity to slow down, move our bodies especially as we eased back into classes after reading week. Participants enjoyed complimentary Ginger Shots and were entered into our giveaway for two FREE passes to Elements Hot Yoga London. Congratulations to our winners! Thank you to everyone who joined us and helped make the evening so special. We loved seeing our community come together for a relaxing night, and we look forward to hosting more events like this in the future.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
